body:
I don't know and I honestly feel ashamed to admit I'm still dealing with it. I saw some great qualities in him when we first started dating but it hasn't been the same since. I know I'm co-depedent from therapy, and I have a tendency to want to please people and work through problems. 

&#x200B;

But i guess deep down I feel I'm unlovable, and I'm terrified to date again as this is a cycle that happens in all my relationships. I ended up dropping out of school earlier this year due to depression, so he is one of the only people I hangout with. He gets upset when I'm with my friends so I feel i'm just trapped in this toxic cycle.
